{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2022-01-05 13:26:00', 'title': 'QUANTA SERVICES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL ENERGY AND CLEAN TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE', 'text': 'HOUSTON, JAN. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUANTA SERVICES, INC. (NYSE:PWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT COMPANY MANAGEMENT WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS GLOBAL ENERGY AND CLEAN TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, JANUARY 6, 2022.\xa0DUKE AUSTIN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL VIRTUALLY PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT HOSTED BY GOLDMAN SACHS ANALYST NEIL MEHTA ON JANUARY 6, 2022 AT 11:00 A.M.'}